{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026E0jEHVrKu61793227895.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>微軟首季度業績好過市場預期，股價在延長交易時段曾升逾百分之6。</p><p></p><p>公司季內純利逾366億美元，按年增長三成二。經調整每股攤薄盈利4.89美元，較預期多16美仙。</p><p></p><p>收入922.7億美元，較預期多約16億美元，當中來自雲端業務的收入達639億美元，增長三成。期內自由現金流減少兩成七至186.3億美元，但較預期多超過100億美元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T23:40:31.482069+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T22:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T10:18:14.313728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T23:38:13.708309+00:00","content_hash":"2689f0a3fe726921d00d7ae85ddcbacbc61994cb09f59a7e706af83456ecaa23","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T23:40:31.482069+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}